one_hyp
-------
l1: $ ~ (P /\ Q) |- ~ (P /\ Q) $ by AS []
l2: $ ~ (P /\ Q) |- ~ P \/ ~ Q $ by DeM [l1]

two_hyps
--------
l1: $ ~ (P /\ Q) ; S |- ~ (P /\ Q) $ by AS []
l2: $ ~ (P /\ Q) ; S |- ~ P \/ ~ Q $ by DeM [l1]

two_hyps_bare
-------------
l1: $ P <-> Q ; S /\ P |- P <-> Q $ by AS []
l2: $ P <-> Q ; S /\ P |- S /\ P $ by AS []
l3: $ P <-> Q ; S /\ P |- S /\ Q $ by replace [l1, l2]
